enron4,pending refund order discussed at today ' s commission meeting,"although a final order is not yet available , we were able to glean the basic content of the commission ' s latest refund order from the discussion had at the commission meeting this morning . it appears that the commission has not strayed far from judge wagner ' s recommendations , which came out of the settlement conference ordered by ferc . highlights include :
