formulation in a very innovative company that uses financial derivatives in
conjunction with real asset investments . the firm , enron , has been the
most innovative company in america for more than five years now and has
expanded its strategy abroad . we have the unique opportunity to document
the firm ' s strategy from the inside with my co - authors being members of the
corporate research staff that manage the pricing of the energy derivatives
